# 🚗 AutoSale Prediction

## 📌 Project Overview
AutoSale Prediction is a Machine Learning project designed to predict automobile sales using historical data and relevant features. The project uses Python and a trained Machine Learning model to generate predictions through a simple Streamlit web application.

## 🎯 Objectives
- Predict automobile sales using Machine Learning.
- Analyze automobile sales data.
- Build an interactive web application using Streamlit.
- Provide a simple interface for users to obtain predictions.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Streamlit
- Pickle
- Machine Learning

